<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Soundcheck fleet · 2 sites</title>
<style>
:root {
  --dot: #E8603A; --bg: #FAFAF9; --card: #FFFFFF; --text: #100F0D; --muted: #6B7280; --line: #E7E5E4; --soft: #F5F5F4;
  --failed: #DC2626; --broke: #DC2626; --interrupted: #6B7280; --errors: #EA580C; --changed: #CA8A04; --warnings: #CA8A04; --clean: #059669;
  --up: #B91C1C; --down: #047857;
  --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "JetBrains Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --dot: #FF7C52; --bg: #100F0D; --card: #1A1917; --text: #F5F5F4; --muted: #A8A29E; --line: #2E2C29; --soft: #23211E;
    --failed: #EF4444; --broke: #EF4444; --interrupted: #A8A29E; --errors: #F97316; --changed: #EAB308; --warnings: #EAB308; --clean: #10B981;
    --up: #F87171; --down: #34D399;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 15px/1.55 var(--sans); }
a { color: inherit; }
.wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px 64px; }
header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 22px 0 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.brand { font-weight: 700; } .brand .dot { color: var(--dot); }
.meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 30px 0 14px; }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.chip { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--card); border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 13px; }
.chip b { color: var(--c); }
.tablewrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--card); }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; }
td.num, th.num { text-align: right; }
.site { font-weight: 650; }
.url { color: var(--muted); font: 12px var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; background: var(--c); border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 7px; white-space: nowrap; }
.err { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.k-failed { --c: var(--failed); } .k-broke { --c: var(--broke); } .k-interrupted { --c: var(--interrupted); } .k-errors { --c: var(--errors); }
.k-changed { --c: var(--changed); } .k-warnings { --c: var(--warnings); } .k-clean { --c: var(--clean); }
.trend { color: var(--muted); }
.move { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }
.move.k-up { color: var(--up); } .move.k-down { color: var(--down); }
.trend svg { display: block; }
footer { margin-top: 36px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header><div class="brand"><span class="dot">♪</span> rhythm soundcheck fleet</div><div class="meta">Comparisons · 26 Oct 2026, 09:30</div></header>
  <h1>Soundcheck fleet · 2 sites</h1>
  <div class="chips"><span class="chip k-broke"><b>1</b> Something broke</span><span class="chip k-clean"><b>1</b> Clean</span></div>
  <div class="tablewrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th class="num">#</th><th>Site</th><th>Result</th><th>Found</th><th class="num">Open a11y issues</th><th class="num">Criteria with failures</th><th>LCP trend</th><th class="num">Pages</th><th class="num">Time</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody><tr>
      <td class="num">1</td>
      <td><div class="site"><a href="shop/.soundcheck/runs/r1/report.html">shop</a></div><div class="url">https://shop.test/</div></td>
      <td><span class="badge k-broke">Something broke</span></td>
      <td>1 broke, 2 new</td>
      <td class="num">12<div class="move k-up"><span aria-hidden="true">↑</span> up from 9 at the last fleet run</div><div class="err"><a href="shop/.soundcheck/runs/r1/eaa/statement-draft.md">Statement draft</a></div></td>
      <td class="num">4</td>
      <td class="trend">–</td>
      <td class="num">40</td>
      <td class="num">2m41s</td>
    </tr><tr>
      <td class="num">2</td>
      <td><div class="site">blog</div><div class="url">https://blog.test/</div></td>
      <td><span class="badge k-clean">Clean</span></td>
      <td>–</td>
      <td class="num"></td>
      <td class="num"></td>
      <td class="trend">–</td>
      <td class="num">12</td>
      <td class="num">30s</td>
    </tr></tbody>
  </table></div>
  <footer>Each site's files are in its own folder next to this page. Made with ♪ rhythm soundcheck.</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
